    "sections": {
        "description": "Capture Minimalism is the best minimalist WordPress theme for photographers, writers, and galleries—yet flexible enough for any business, blog, or startup. Built for speed, it’s the fastest, fully responsive, mobile-friendly theme optimized for search engines with schema markup and perfect SEO structure. Whether you're a wedding photographer, portrait artist, or blogger, Capture Minimalism delivers clean design, lightbox galleries, and a one-page layout that enhances your image, gallery, or photo studio. This free minimal FSE theme supports Gutenberg Block Editor, Visual Composer, and any page builder, making it ideal for ecommerce, advertisement, landing pages, or affiliate and Adsense monetization. It’s fully WooCommerce ready with translation ready support and dark mode for modern publishing. Use the sidebar or go full width. Writers will love its distraction, free writing space, while online photo portfolios and travel blogs will benefit from its sleek, conversion-driven design. Capture Minimalism is more than a blogging or photo theme, it’s your visual template for success."
    },
